⚠️ `ps aux | grep -c "[t]est_..."` ALSO false-positives (the SHELL carries the pattern in its own argv);
**bracket ≠ self-match proof**. ⚠️ **A KILLED WATCHER IS NOT A KILLED SUITE** — check `ps` + log progress,
never a notification's status word. ⚠️ **CPU ≪ elapsed ≠ hung** when children exist; `pgrep -P` first.
